            timezoneUpdate: $timezoneUpdate,
            localeUpdate: $localeUpdate,
        ));
    }

    /**
     * Removes devices, selected by ids and/or users.
     * Centrifugo PRO only.
     *
     * Adds the command to the batch: its Pending holds the result once the
     * batch is sent.
     *
     * @param list<string> $ids Selects devices to remove by ID.
     * @param list<string> $users Selects devices to remove by user.
     *
     * @return Pending<DeviceRemoveResult>
     */
    public function deviceRemove(
        array $ids = [],
        array $users = [],
    ): Pending {
        return $this->add(new DeviceRemoveRequest(ids: $ids, users: $users));
    }

    /**
     * Returns a paginated list of registered devices.
     * Centrifugo PRO only.
     *
     * Adds the command to the batch: its Pending holds the result once the
     * batch is sent.
     *
     * @param DeviceFilter $filter Selects the devices to list. Required.
     * @param bool $includeTotalCount Includes the total count for the filter in the
     *     result.
     * @param bool $includeMeta Includes meta of each device.
     * @param bool $includeTopics Includes topics of each device.
     * @param bool $includeWebpushKeys Includes $webpushKeys of each device (webpush
     *     only).
     * @param string $cursor The pagination cursor: $nextCursor of the previous page,
     *     empty for the first page.
     * @param int $limit The maximum number of devices to return.
     *
     * @return Pending<DeviceListResult>
     */
    public function deviceList(
        DeviceFilter $filter,
        bool $includeTotalCount = false,
        bool $includeMeta = false,
        bool $includeTopics = false,
        bool $includeWebpushKeys = false,
        string $cursor = '',
        int $limit = 0,
    ): Pending {
        return $this->add(new DeviceListRequest(
            filter: $filter,
            includeTotalCount: $includeTotalCount,
            includeMeta: $includeMeta,
            includeTopics: $includeTopics,
            includeWebpushKeys: $includeWebpushKeys,
            cursor: $cursor,
            limit: $limit,
        ));
    }

    /**
     * Returns a paginated list of device topic
     * subscriptions. Centrifugo PRO only.
     *
     * Adds the command to the batch: its Pending holds the result once the
     * batch is sent.
